    "description": {
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "User story"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "As a GIS user, I want Cancel to discard an unsaved Surveyor filter edit without adding a layer or changing the map."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Scope and setup"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Start at https://o2intelligence-v4-dev.metricell.com/launcher using authorised V4 access. Use only normal UI controls. Open GIS and record the unobscured settled map view and complete existing Map layers entries/order. An absent list is a valid baseline. Open Surveyor configuration from its catalogue control. Use only the synthetic value TEST2-showcase-unsaved. Do not select Add layer, save data, change existing layers or modify saved settings."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Acceptance criteria"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "orderedList",
          "attrs": {
            "order": 1
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Surveyor configuration displays Username, Cancel and Add layer controls. Enter TEST2-showcase-unsaved; the entire value is visibly present in Username before cancellation."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Select Cancel, then reopen Surveyor configuration. The reopened Username field is empty, with Cancel and Add layer available."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Cancel the reopened dialog to finish. The unobscured map view and complete Map layers entries/order match the original pre-dialog baseline, with no new Surveyor layer."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Evidence and cleanup"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Capture the edited value, closed dialog, reopened empty field and final restored map. Put the original/final comparison states in the evidence for the unchanged-state criterion, using that criterion's own journey. Record actual browser-derived final URLs. Leave the dialog closed and preserve all pre-existing state."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "User-guide relevance"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Use the existing “Opening and cancelling Surveyor configuration in V4 GIS” section. Amend it only if passing evidence establishes a genuine missing instruction; otherwise no guide change is needed. Preserve existing useful guidance and highlight any new/changed content in yellow."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
